                    "decoration": "INFO",
                    "content": {
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "locale": "en",
                          "text": "This form shows the behavior of (external) enumerations with custom values in the document. All types should show this value, but only External Enumeration with \"customValuesAllowed\" should be selectable. The custom value can be used in all types of expressions only for these external enumerations as well. You can use the \"Show Data\" feature from the left to verify the current data in the document."
                        }
